      "title": "Lip sync: a clip redubbed to new audio with InfiniteTalk",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Lip sync: a clip redubbed to new audio with InfiniteTalk\n\nMakes the person in your clip speak your audio with InfiniteTalk through the ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper nodes on Wan 2.1 I2V 14B, keeping the clip's motion, then trims the video to the length of the audio. Built from the wrapper's example wanvideo_2_1_14B_V2V_InfiniteTalk_example_02.\n\n## Models\n\n- [Wan2_1-InfiniTetalk-Single_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/InfiniteTalk/Wan2_1-InfiniTetalk-Single_fp16.safetensors): InfiniteTalk single-speaker patch, Kijai's build, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/MeiGen-AI/InfiniteTalk).\n- [lightx2v_I2V_14B_480p_cfg_step_distill_rank64_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Lightx2v/lightx2v_I2V_14B_480p_cfg_step_distill_rank64_bf16.safetensors): lightx2v Wan 2.1 I2V 480P step-distill LoRA, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P-StepDistill-CfgDistill-Lightx2v).\n- [Wan2_1-I2V-14B-480p_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_KJ.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy_fp8_scaled/resolve/main/I2V/Wan2_1-I2V-14B-480p_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_KJ.safetensors): Wan 2.1 I2V 14B 480P, fp8, Kijai's build, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P).\n- [Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors): Wan 2.1 VAE, Kijai's build, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P).\n- [wav2vec2-chinese-base_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/wav2vec2_safetensors/resolve/main/wav2vec2-chinese-base_fp16.safetensors): chinese-wav2vec2-base audio encoder, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/TencentGameMate/chinese-wav2vec2-base).\n- [clip_vision_h.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan-Animate-2/resolve/main/clip_vision/clip_vision_h.safetensors): CLIP ViT-H vision encoder, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/laion/CLIP-ViT-H-14-laion2B-s32B-b79K).\n- [umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors): umt5-xxl encoder, Kijai's build, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/google/umt5-xxl).\n\n## Custom nodes\n\n- [ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper](https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper) at commit `088128b224242e110d3906c6750e9a3a348a659b`, Apache-2.0.\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
